# S204's WITNESS, and the reason it needs one is worth stating: after
# W1.1 taught verify_rxt.py the corpus's other four line kinds, NO corpus
# line reaches its unknown-kind branch any more. Fixing the gap is what
# emptied the population of the row that guards it.
#
# `tag` is a real .rxt keyword of a LATER WAVE. All three parsers must
# refuse it rather than swallow it: pcrec by name ("not in this build"),
# run.sh through its catch-all hard error, verify_rxt.py by raising. A
# parser that treats a kind it does not know as a comment verifies
# nothing and says nothing, which is the quiet failure S204 plants.
pattern a+
tag beta
m "aaa" 0 3
